WEBVTT

00:00:26.000 --> 00:00:31.375
Encore! Encore! Encore! Encore!

00:00:31.375 --> 00:00:37.000
--Encore! Encore! Encore! Encore! Encore!

00:00:37.000 --> 00:00:38.500
--Thank you! Thank you!
--Encore! Encore! Encore! Encore! Encore!

00:00:38.500 --> 00:00:40.333
All righty then!
Here we go, one last time!

00:00:40.333 --> 00:00:42.208
"Actual Size 45 cm"

00:00:42.667 --> 00:00:46.417
♪ I, Koshi Rikdo, give my permission ♪

00:00:46.417 --> 00:00:52.500
♪ to turn "Excel Saga" into
a rock anime, a rock anime! ♪

00:00:52.500 --> 00:00:54.000
Thank you!

00:01:13.542 --> 00:01:18.875
"Koshi Rikdo"

00:01:29.583 --> 00:01:33.500
<i>That isn't love</i>

00:01:33.500 --> 00:01:37.292
<i>Love isn't that</i>

00:01:37.292 --> 00:01:45.208
<i>I am in love, but I am not loved</i>

00:01:45.208 --> 00:01:49.083
<i>Definitely isn't love</i>

00:01:49.083 --> 00:01:53.125
<i>Derriere isn't love</i>

00:01:53.125 --> 00:02:00.833
<i>I want to be loved,</i>
<i>but I never seek it out</i>

00:02:01.792 --> 00:02:05.667
<i>I offer myself and throw my life away</i>

00:02:05.667 --> 00:02:09.708
<i>Looking neither left nor right,</i>
<i>I will just earnestly</i>

00:02:09.708 --> 00:02:13.625
<i>Cheat, wheedle, interfere</i>

00:02:13.625 --> 00:02:16.833
<i>And trample down and</i>
<i>kick strangers</i>

00:02:16.833 --> 00:02:19.083
<i>And we get the hell out!</i>
<i>(And we get the hell out!)</i>

00:02:19.083 --> 00:02:21.000
<i>And we get the hell out!</i>
<i>(And we get the hell out!)</i>

00:02:21.000 --> 00:02:22.750
<i>And we get the hell out!</i>
<i>(And we get the hell out!)</i>

00:02:22.750 --> 00:02:24.750
<i>And we get the hell out!</i>

00:02:24.750 --> 00:02:29.500
<i>Even if I slip on a banana peel</i>

00:02:29.500 --> 00:02:32.750
<i>It is all for his sake anyway</i>

00:02:32.750 --> 00:02:37.292
<i>If anything, that is probably</i>

00:02:37.292 --> 00:02:45.125
<i>A kind of loyalty called love</i>

00:02:52.917 --> 00:02:53.625
"Celebrate Fishing"

00:02:56.708 --> 00:02:57.333
"The 7th Kinpira Maru"

00:02:59.208 --> 00:03:00.292
Mr. Kyuubei,

00:03:00.292 --> 00:03:03.292
a ship is approaching us
at high speed from up ahead!

00:03:04.292 --> 00:03:05.667
A yacht...

00:03:05.667 --> 00:03:08.625
No, it seems to be a small cruiser,

00:03:09.458 --> 00:03:11.792
but still, what speed!

00:03:11.792 --> 00:03:15.042
It will presently
pass to our starboard.

00:03:35.500 --> 00:03:38.167
What in the world was that?

00:03:38.167 --> 00:03:40.667
But how beautiful.

00:03:44.250 --> 00:03:46.250
Hail, Ilpalazzo!

00:03:47.917 --> 00:03:49.875
Where is Excel?

00:03:49.875 --> 00:03:50.750
--Yes, Senior is over here...

00:03:50.750 --> 00:03:52.500
--Yes, yes, yes! Lord Ilpalazzo!
--Yes, Senior is over here...

00:03:52.500 --> 00:03:53.917
I, Excel, am certainly, definitely,

00:03:53.917 --> 00:03:56.917
absolutely here, more
than you'd ever want me to be!

00:03:56.917 --> 00:03:58.458
Please pardon me, Lord Ilpalazzo!

00:03:58.458 --> 00:04:01.375
It was thought that it might be
obscured by the review episode,

00:04:01.375 --> 00:04:05.500
but Hyatt and I utterly failed the
important mission you assigned us.

00:04:05.500 --> 00:04:07.750
The Mexican anglerfish that
you ordered us to capture and collect,

00:04:07.750 --> 00:04:08.750
as well as the Himalayan giant anteater,

00:04:08.750 --> 00:04:11.083
and your shy childhood friend
with the big boobs and glasses

00:04:11.083 --> 00:04:12.542
did not exist on this world!

00:04:12.542 --> 00:04:14.042
They were all fictional
things non-existent among

00:04:14.042 --> 00:04:15.542
the real people, organizations,
and original work.

00:04:15.542 --> 00:04:17.083
Nevertheless,
a failure is a failure!

00:04:17.083 --> 00:04:20.750
I have scaled down my existence
to 1/144 to express my regret!

00:04:20.750 --> 00:04:22.917
Yes, I know, I do not think
you will forgive me just for that,

00:04:22.917 --> 00:04:24.333
but I, Excel,
would be happy if you would

00:04:24.333 --> 00:04:28.000
take this spirit of regret
into consideration just a little...

00:04:32.333 --> 00:04:34.333
Hail, Ilpalazzo!

00:04:34.333 --> 00:04:37.375
Well, it is good that
you have the spirit of regret.

00:04:37.375 --> 00:04:40.667
My plans may also have
been somewhat unreasonable.

00:04:40.667 --> 00:04:43.083
I may have done it to hasten
the realization of our ideals,

00:04:43.083 --> 00:04:45.083
but it was foolish of me.

00:04:46.708 --> 00:04:49.375
Lord Ilpalazzo!

00:04:50.083 --> 00:04:52.833
Absolutely not! <i>We </i>are the fools!

00:04:52.833 --> 00:04:54.167
Oh, and Hatchan's collapsed again.

00:04:54.167 --> 00:04:56.125
Lord Ilpalazzo, it is a sin for
a noble person such as yourself

00:04:56.125 --> 00:04:57.917
to be so self-deprecating!

00:04:57.917 --> 00:04:59.917
It is a beautiful sin!

00:05:00.750 --> 00:05:04.083
By the way, ACROSS HQ has
sent orders to make some changes

00:05:04.083 --> 00:05:06.917
to the progress of our
plans in conquering the city.

00:05:06.917 --> 00:05:09.333
Th-That is a tremendous
plot development!

00:05:09.333 --> 00:05:10.750
What sort of change?

00:05:10.750 --> 00:05:12.583
And Hatchan's recovered!

00:05:13.583 --> 00:05:15.417
I was told to hear the details

00:05:15.417 --> 00:05:18.792
directly from a messenger
dispatched from HQ,

00:05:18.792 --> 00:05:20.125
but he is late.

00:05:20.125 --> 00:05:22.708
He should have been here long ago.

00:05:23.625 --> 00:05:25.292
Who are you?!

00:05:35.625 --> 00:05:38.292
Are you the messenger from HQ?

00:05:38.292 --> 00:05:39.958
Why were you late?

00:05:40.500 --> 00:05:43.167
Let us hear your reasons for that first.

00:05:43.167 --> 00:05:44.542
I'm Key.

00:05:44.542 --> 00:05:45.792
I'm a key.

00:05:45.792 --> 00:05:47.833
And could the keyhole...

00:05:47.833 --> 00:05:49.250
...be you?

00:05:50.833 --> 00:05:52.875
My heart is heat!
Unused to such love attacks,

00:05:52.875 --> 00:05:54.292
the flutter in my heart is in an uproar!

00:05:54.292 --> 00:05:57.500
No, on top of no, no!
I have Lord Ilpalazzo...

00:05:57.500 --> 00:05:58.625
<i>Damn you, bastard,</i>

00:05:58.625 --> 00:06:00.292
<i>just because you're</i>
<i>a little visually appealing.</i>

00:06:00.292 --> 00:06:02.458
<i>Don't go acting cool when you're not,</i>
<i>you poser. Stupid, stupid, stupid!</i>

00:06:02.458 --> 00:06:05.167
<i>I'll make you die.</i>
<i>I'll definitely make you die.</i>

00:06:05.167 --> 00:06:08.583
Key, we are very busy,
so forget about your personal matters

00:06:08.583 --> 00:06:11.333
and let me hear the orders
from HQ. Immediately.

00:06:11.333 --> 00:06:12.667
Sure.

00:06:23.667 --> 00:06:25.958
Look where the microphone came from.

00:06:36.958 --> 00:06:42.333
"City Conquest Modification Briefing"
"Lyrics ACROSS HQ"

00:06:42.333 --> 00:06:48.542
"Music & Arrangement Toshio Masuda"
"Performed by Key"

00:07:04.208 --> 00:07:05.750
My soul...

00:07:06.833 --> 00:07:09.708
My soul has lost sight of the path.

00:07:09.708 --> 00:07:13.042
The path that I must travel.

00:07:13.042 --> 00:07:19.542
Surrounded by concrete walls,
lost in a prison that is the city.

00:07:19.542 --> 00:07:21.875
What is the matter?

00:07:21.875 --> 00:07:23.417
They're heavy.

00:07:23.417 --> 00:07:26.917
My heart is bound
by chains made of roses.

00:07:26.917 --> 00:07:29.750
As long as they are there,
I can't sing the verses.

00:07:29.750 --> 00:07:31.750
What is this about?

00:07:31.750 --> 00:07:35.667
As a vocalist and as a
Lucifer that has sold his soul to rock,

00:07:35.667 --> 00:07:37.583
I can't sing under
unsatisfactory conditions.

00:07:37.583 --> 00:07:40.333
You do not need to sing.
You just need to report.

00:07:40.333 --> 00:07:44.250
Please. Are you even going
to take melody away from me?

00:07:44.250 --> 00:07:48.292
When those fleeting moments
are my only source of pleasure?

00:07:49.375 --> 00:07:53.417
Then when will you be released
from these so-called chains?

00:07:53.417 --> 00:07:56.375
Who knows?
The goddess of rock is capricious.

00:07:56.375 --> 00:08:01.667
Maybe five minutes from now.
Maybe a year. She's toying with my heart.

00:08:01.667 --> 00:08:03.750
Excel, Hyatt...

00:08:03.750 --> 00:08:04.875
Yes?

00:08:04.875 --> 00:08:07.542
I order you to stay with
him no matter what you do

00:08:07.542 --> 00:08:10.042
until something happens with his heart.

00:08:10.958 --> 00:08:12.292
In other words,

00:08:12.292 --> 00:08:15.958
you wish us to take him with us
to our hideout and part-time jobs?

00:08:15.958 --> 00:08:17.292
I am counting on you.

00:08:17.292 --> 00:08:19.750
Do not let him into this base until then.

00:08:19.750 --> 00:08:21.750
Roger, Sir.

00:08:23.667 --> 00:08:26.500
Pleased to be in your company, angels.

00:08:27.625 --> 00:08:29.125
<i>Quit putting on a show!</i>

00:08:29.125 --> 00:08:31.333
<i>Giving yourself an artist's airs,</i>
<i>you narcissistic bastard!</i>

00:08:31.333 --> 00:08:33.542
<i>Nar-bastard! Nar-nar bastard!</i>

00:08:33.542 --> 00:08:36.000
<i>Disappear! Leave! Go away, away!</i>

00:08:36.000 --> 00:08:39.667
Senior, shall we have him
come with us to our part-time job now?

00:08:39.667 --> 00:08:40.750
Yeah.

00:08:40.750 --> 00:08:42.500
Lord Ilpalazzo, your humble servants,

00:08:42.500 --> 00:08:45.875
Excel and Hyatt will give
this mission our very best shot!

00:09:01.667 --> 00:09:03.833
And so, today's part-time job is at a club!

00:09:03.833 --> 00:09:08.625
Senior? This outfit
rather emphasizes the breasts...

00:09:09.500 --> 00:09:11.750
You sly little... Casually attracting
attention to yourself.

00:09:11.750 --> 00:09:14.542
Besides, that's the idea
behind this outfit, so it's okay.

00:09:14.542 --> 00:09:16.458
Oh, is that so?

00:09:18.375 --> 00:09:22.000
A small, dark, crowded stage.

00:09:22.000 --> 00:09:24.750
But this atmosphere
is the same anywhere.

00:09:24.750 --> 00:09:27.000
The sweat of
those who burn their talents,

00:09:27.000 --> 00:09:29.833
greedily seeking their dreams.
And their tears.

00:09:29.833 --> 00:09:35.375
A blend of passion and ambition.
My favorite kind of <i>café au lait</i>.

00:09:35.375 --> 00:09:37.292
What the hell are we gonna do?!

00:09:37.292 --> 00:09:39.417
That Pokkii quit all of a sudden!

00:09:39.417 --> 00:09:42.375
Nothing we can do about it!
He didn't fit in to begin with!

00:09:42.375 --> 00:09:44.250
But what about
tonight's live performance?

00:09:44.250 --> 00:09:46.542
The producer from the recording
company is coming, right?

00:09:46.542 --> 00:09:49.125
Chappii, you sing! You're the leader!

00:09:49.125 --> 00:09:51.792
You idiot! I've got my hands
full playing the drums!

00:09:51.792 --> 00:09:52.958
Creamy, you do it!

00:09:52.958 --> 00:09:56.375
I can't, I'll bite my tongue.
My tangue gets tungled.

00:09:56.375 --> 00:09:58.292
What are we gonna do? Do we cancel?

00:09:58.292 --> 00:10:00.208
It's too late for that now!

00:10:00.208 --> 00:10:02.708
Looks like your dream
is about to slip away.

00:10:02.708 --> 00:10:04.250
Who are you?!

00:10:04.250 --> 00:10:08.208
I'm just a vocalist,
who happened to be passing by.

00:10:09.042 --> 00:10:10.417
Vocalist?

00:10:14.958 --> 00:10:16.417
Here's some empty bottles.

00:10:16.417 --> 00:10:18.333
Thank you, Senior.

00:10:18.333 --> 00:10:20.667
It's really bustling though, isn't it?

00:10:20.667 --> 00:10:22.333
Yes, it is.

00:10:22.333 --> 00:10:24.750
Oh? Come to think of it, where is Mr. Key?

00:10:24.750 --> 00:10:27.208
I don't know. Come to
think of it, he's nowhere in sight.

00:10:27.208 --> 00:10:29.667
This is no time for
"come to think of it"!

00:10:31.083 --> 00:10:34.542
We're counting on you
for the usual Mohawk sound!

00:10:34.542 --> 00:10:36.417
Hey, the vocalist's different.

00:10:36.417 --> 00:10:37.667
Who the hell is he?!

00:10:37.667 --> 00:10:39.667
He doesn't have a Mohawk!

00:10:42.250 --> 00:10:43.583
Give me music.

00:10:43.583 --> 00:10:45.250
A real scorcher.

00:10:48.583 --> 00:10:51.917
"Punk Tongue Twisters"
"Lyrics Chappii"

00:10:51.917 --> 00:10:55.375
"Music & Arrangement Toshio Masuda"
"Performed by Key with Mohawk Brothers"

00:10:56.250 --> 00:10:57.958
The guest next door
that eats a lot of persimmons

00:10:57.958 --> 00:10:59.792
works at the Tokyo Patent Office.

00:10:59.792 --> 00:11:01.167
The two chickens that were in the yard

00:11:01.167 --> 00:11:04.167
got caught in the bus's gas explosion!

00:11:08.083 --> 00:11:09.458
He is very good.

00:11:09.458 --> 00:11:11.958
What the monk drew on the
folding screen was a skilled painting

00:11:11.958 --> 00:11:15.625
of a monk in a spaced out
pose and Jaws, baby.

00:11:22.333 --> 00:11:23.958
Raw wheat, raw rice, raw eggs.

00:11:23.958 --> 00:11:25.708
Raw feet, raw sweets, raw conger eel.

00:11:25.708 --> 00:11:27.333
The love letter to you.

00:11:27.333 --> 00:11:28.875
Red rolled paper,
blue rolled paper, yellow rolled paper,

00:11:28.875 --> 00:11:30.292
which should I write it on?

00:11:30.292 --> 00:11:34.292
In red pajamas, brown pajamas,
blue pajamas, in bed, making love!

00:11:35.500 --> 00:11:39.958
--Encore! Encore! Encore! Encore!
Encore! Encore! Encore! Encore!

00:11:39.958 --> 00:11:42.750
--It seems that he is able to sing now.
--Encore! Encore! Encore! Encore!

00:11:42.750 --> 00:11:46.042
Do you think that perhaps we
have accomplished our mission?

00:11:46.042 --> 00:11:47.542
--Senior?
--Encore! Encore! Encore! Encore!

00:11:49.333 --> 00:11:53.667
If you want to hear my songs,
try begging the mischievous goddess.

00:11:53.667 --> 00:11:55.000
Later.

00:12:00.458 --> 00:12:02.458
Seems good.

00:12:10.500 --> 00:12:11.833
What are we going to do?!

00:12:11.833 --> 00:12:15.292
My wife... Ms. Will...
Can't we get them back?!

00:12:15.292 --> 00:12:16.583
Mama...

00:12:16.583 --> 00:12:19.792
I never thought that he
would already be this strong.

00:12:19.792 --> 00:12:22.583
Mr. Nabeshin, what are
you saying? We've come so far.

00:12:22.583 --> 00:12:25.250
Is there really nothing more we can do?

00:12:26.167 --> 00:12:27.125
Pedro...

00:12:27.125 --> 00:12:29.333
Why?

00:12:29.333 --> 00:12:32.542
If you have the determination, go here.

00:12:32.542 --> 00:12:35.833
You still have potential,
depending on training.

00:12:35.833 --> 00:12:38.083
Go here and get training!

00:12:38.208 --> 00:12:39.417
"Secret Base"   "Tibet"   "Here"
"Convenience Store"   "Current Location"

00:12:39.417 --> 00:12:40.917
This place is...

00:12:40.917 --> 00:12:43.333
Holy ground where
a man polishes himself!

00:12:43.333 --> 00:12:44.833
Nabe's Hole!

00:12:49.042 --> 00:12:52.375
Na-Nabe's Hole?!

00:12:52.375 --> 00:12:54.000
Let's go, Papa!

00:12:54.000 --> 00:12:57.375
Let's both get
stronger and go save Mama!

00:12:57.375 --> 00:12:59.333
Sandora...

00:12:59.333 --> 00:13:00.917
All right!

00:13:00.917 --> 00:13:04.083
Let's go, Sandora!
No matter how harsh the training,

00:13:04.083 --> 00:13:07.250
together, we can surely endure it!

00:13:07.250 --> 00:13:08.875
Dad!

00:13:08.875 --> 00:13:10.917
Sandora!

00:13:10.917 --> 00:13:14.208
Let's go, to Nabe's Hole!

00:13:14.208 --> 00:13:19.167
<i>That's right, Pedro, Sandora. Onward!</i>

00:13:20.000 --> 00:13:22.000
Oh, shoot, it ended!

00:13:22.417 --> 00:13:22.875
"Take 2"

00:13:22.875 --> 00:13:25.208
Gotta set the partition straight again.

00:13:26.917 --> 00:13:28.208
Solo debut?

00:13:28.208 --> 00:13:30.708
That wasn't the original deal.

00:13:30.708 --> 00:13:33.083
No, it wasn't.

00:13:33.083 --> 00:13:35.917
All I did was help them out.

00:13:35.917 --> 00:13:40.167
Your vocal is the real thing.
So much so, it can't be helped.

00:13:40.167 --> 00:13:46.458
I'm not such a fool that I would
grab steel when there's gold.

00:13:47.458 --> 00:13:49.333
Wait a minute!

00:13:49.333 --> 00:13:51.625
Then what's gonna happen to us?!

00:13:51.625 --> 00:13:54.667
Ms. Producer, you're going
to take him over us?!

00:13:54.667 --> 00:13:56.042
So you were listening?

00:13:56.042 --> 00:13:58.125
The answer to that is yes, of course.

00:13:58.125 --> 00:14:01.500
Only those with real ability
can survive in this world.

00:14:01.500 --> 00:14:03.333
We've got real ability too.

00:14:03.333 --> 00:14:09.000
Even if you did, I would choose
the one with the better looks.

00:14:09.000 --> 00:14:10.458
As a pro.

00:14:10.458 --> 00:14:12.000
Shock!

00:14:16.292 --> 00:14:18.625
Now, come with me!

00:14:18.625 --> 00:14:20.750
The world will dance to your voice!

00:14:20.750 --> 00:14:24.333
Let us deliver the bible
of 8-beat to the lost peoples.

00:14:24.333 --> 00:14:26.542
Hey, you! Wait a minute!

00:14:26.542 --> 00:14:27.875
Who are you two?!

00:14:27.875 --> 00:14:30.042
He's with us!

00:14:30.042 --> 00:14:32.583
If we have you making deals when
we're not around, then it would be,

00:14:32.583 --> 00:14:34.917
"Oh, how embarrassing!"

00:14:34.917 --> 00:14:36.958
Okay?! This man here has
a much more important mission

00:14:36.958 --> 00:14:39.875
than vulgar music for the masses!

00:14:39.875 --> 00:14:40.958
Mission?

00:14:40.958 --> 00:14:42.500
Come, let us go.

00:14:42.500 --> 00:14:45.542
Lending your ear to such
frivolous nonsense is a no-no.

00:14:45.542 --> 00:14:47.833
After all, we have a lofty goal.

00:14:47.833 --> 00:14:50.833
Hey! What is it that
you <i>really </i>want to do?!

00:14:50.833 --> 00:14:54.667
No, I can tell! Your soul
is waiting to be set free!

00:14:54.667 --> 00:14:57.833
You ought to achieve it with
as many onlookers as possible!

00:14:57.833 --> 00:15:01.042
You should be in a place worthy
of you to carve yourself up!

00:15:01.042 --> 00:15:03.125
I can give you that!

00:15:03.125 --> 00:15:04.875
Tomorrow, there's
a rock fest on the bayside,

00:15:04.875 --> 00:15:06.292
a gathering of new bands.

00:15:06.292 --> 00:15:08.875
If you want to start
your own legend, come!

00:15:08.875 --> 00:15:09.875
We won't go!

00:15:09.875 --> 00:15:11.375
You need not come!

00:15:11.375 --> 00:15:12.542
We'll go!

00:15:12.542 --> 00:15:14.042
You need not come either!

00:15:14.042 --> 00:15:15.250
I'll be waiting.

00:15:15.250 --> 00:15:15.708
--Yes, Ma'am!

00:15:15.708 --> 00:15:17.708
--I said, don't come!
--Yes, Ma'am!

00:15:23.042 --> 00:15:24.542
Yo!

00:15:25.708 --> 00:15:26.542
Oh, my.

00:15:26.542 --> 00:15:30.208
Actually, I got gift certificates
to a restaurant from work.

00:15:30.208 --> 00:15:32.417
If you haven't eaten yet,
want to go together...

00:15:32.417 --> 00:15:35.083
My, thank you so much.

00:15:36.000 --> 00:15:40.875
But I have a guest tonight, so...

00:15:41.875 --> 00:15:43.708
Perhaps another time.

00:15:43.708 --> 00:15:45.208
This way.

00:15:46.458 --> 00:15:47.417
It was a guy.

00:15:47.417 --> 00:15:48.292
"It's a guy."

00:15:48.292 --> 00:15:49.458
At this rate, tonight...

00:15:49.458 --> 00:15:50.750
"Yeah, make love."

00:15:50.750 --> 00:15:53.292
What's with you guys?!
Don't think such impure thoughts!

00:15:53.292 --> 00:15:54.875
That's got to be a cousin or a relative!

00:15:54.875 --> 00:15:56.417
Or that other girl's boyfriend!

00:15:56.417 --> 00:15:58.583
That's right! That's right!
That's what he is!

00:15:58.583 --> 00:16:01.250
This is unseemly!
Look reality in the face!

00:16:01.250 --> 00:16:03.958
You're a lonely guy
that's been completely dumped!

00:16:03.958 --> 00:16:05.292
Shut up!

00:16:06.125 --> 00:16:08.542
Come right on in!

00:16:08.542 --> 00:16:11.917
Is there anything that you cannot eat?

00:16:11.917 --> 00:16:13.292
Like dog?

00:16:14.250 --> 00:16:17.125
No, don't mind me.

00:16:17.125 --> 00:16:20.208
It's better when both my
stomach and heart are starving.

00:16:20.208 --> 00:16:21.750
Is that how things work?

00:16:21.750 --> 00:16:22.875
And, er...

00:16:22.875 --> 00:16:23.667
What is it?

00:16:23.667 --> 00:16:27.583
What about the
report from ACROSS HQ?

00:16:27.583 --> 00:16:29.833
The chains have yet to unravel.

00:16:29.833 --> 00:16:32.958
What? But you were singing so
enthusiastically just now.

00:16:32.958 --> 00:16:34.458
That's different.

00:16:34.458 --> 00:16:38.000
Truly precious verses
don't come out easily.

00:16:38.000 --> 00:16:39.167
Or...

00:16:40.958 --> 00:16:43.875
It could be that I'm still lost as well.

00:16:44.875 --> 00:16:49.000
I see. Then shall we
go to sleep for tonight?

00:16:49.000 --> 00:16:51.792
Sleep?!

00:16:51.792 --> 00:16:53.000
Yes?

00:16:58.667 --> 00:17:00.167
For the time being...

00:17:00.167 --> 00:17:01.958
Goodnight.

00:17:01.958 --> 00:17:03.125
Sure.

00:17:08.792 --> 00:17:11.250
Hatchan, are you asleep?

00:17:11.250 --> 00:17:13.833
Her sleeping face is
bad for the heart, as usual.

00:17:21.875 --> 00:17:24.208
Oh, it's a guitar.

00:17:24.208 --> 00:17:27.708
How long am I going to keep drowning
in this love, fluttering, and kiss?

00:17:27.708 --> 00:17:28.708
Please believe me!

00:17:28.708 --> 00:17:32.500
You are the only one I swear my
loyalty to, Lord Ilpalazzo!

00:17:38.000 --> 00:17:42.667
Lord Ilpalazzo! Lord Ilpalazzo!
Hail, hairi fure Lord Ilpalazzo!

00:17:44.125 --> 00:17:47.042
Ilpalazzo!

00:17:47.042 --> 00:17:49.375
Key!

00:17:51.917 --> 00:17:53.250
Hug!

00:17:53.583 --> 00:17:55.417
Rolling, rolling.

00:17:57.083 --> 00:18:00.250
Play my guitar.

00:18:00.250 --> 00:18:03.542
Conquer my body.

00:18:03.542 --> 00:18:06.208
My thoughts are heading
in a terrible direction!

00:18:08.792 --> 00:18:12.042
Involuntary sleep is the only
way to go on nights like these!

00:18:20.208 --> 00:18:22.917
Damn it, I hear yelling
and screaming and stuff.

00:18:22.917 --> 00:18:24.417
That's so intense!

00:18:24.417 --> 00:18:25.625
"Ah, they're so young..."

00:18:26.542 --> 00:18:30.708
It's over, my youth...

00:18:30.708 --> 00:18:34.958
What are you talking about?
You didn't have a youth to begin with.

00:18:40.583 --> 00:18:42.125
I can't believe

00:18:42.125 --> 00:18:46.625
that I almost let myself be swept
away by a moment of kindness.

00:18:46.625 --> 00:18:48.542
A stray dog that's been tamed once

00:18:48.542 --> 00:18:51.208
can never howl again like it used to.

00:18:51.208 --> 00:18:52.875
In the end,

00:18:53.417 --> 00:18:55.750
my place is on the stage.

00:18:59.750 --> 00:19:03.292
Tell those angels that I'll
let them hear my best shout.

00:19:13.083 --> 00:19:14.875
He's not here!

00:19:14.875 --> 00:19:16.167
We looked away for just a little while!

00:19:16.167 --> 00:19:19.167
A little while?
You were asleep like the dead.

00:19:19.167 --> 00:19:21.625
Don't say that, because
when you say it, it isn't funny.

00:19:21.625 --> 00:19:23.333
Forget about that!

00:19:23.333 --> 00:19:25.792
Where is he right now?! Wearing what?!
And doing what with whom?!

00:19:25.792 --> 00:19:28.125
Senior, considering the
flow of the story,

00:19:28.125 --> 00:19:30.833
perhaps he has gone to the rock fest?

00:19:31.625 --> 00:19:35.208
Oh, okay! All right, Hatchan,
we'll go-go there too!

00:19:36.667 --> 00:19:39.875
But we do not
know where it is taking place.

00:19:39.875 --> 00:19:41.208
Oh, that's right!

00:19:41.208 --> 00:19:43.208
We're in a half-baked fix!

00:19:50.708 --> 00:19:52.583
"Singing 1268 hours straight!!"
"Visually Appealing Bands"

00:19:52.583 --> 00:19:54.250
Visually appealing.

00:20:15.042 --> 00:20:16.625
Yo.

00:20:16.625 --> 00:20:17.958
You came.

00:20:30.500 --> 00:20:33.833
Ilpalazzo, I came all
the way across the ocean

00:20:33.833 --> 00:20:35.667
just to let you hear this!

00:20:35.667 --> 00:20:36.792
Listen to this!

00:20:36.792 --> 00:20:40.542
"City Conquest Modification Briefing"
"Lyrics ACROSS HQ"

00:20:40.542 --> 00:20:44.542
"Music & Arrangement Toshio Masuda"
"Performed by Key"

00:20:47.292 --> 00:20:50.083
Ilpalazzo, what are
you dawdling over?! Hey, hey!

00:20:50.083 --> 00:20:52.458
Taking so much time
over just one city!

00:20:52.458 --> 00:20:54.333
Talk about stupid!
Talk about incompetent!

00:20:54.333 --> 00:20:56.875
Quit being a slowpoke
and coming up with cheap plans!

00:20:56.875 --> 00:20:59.458
If you don't hurry up
and produce some results...

00:20:59.458 --> 00:21:00.958
Ilpalazzo!

00:21:02.708 --> 00:21:06.500
Ilpalazzo! Ilpalazzo!
You secretly play girl-get games!

00:21:06.500 --> 00:21:08.000
Ilpalazzo!

00:21:19.125 --> 00:21:21.250
It's all my fault.

00:21:21.250 --> 00:21:22.750
All because I was being
weak and wavering

00:21:22.750 --> 00:21:24.708
between the mission
and the fluttering in my heart.

00:21:24.708 --> 00:21:26.125
Hatchan, what should I do?

00:21:26.125 --> 00:21:27.917
I do not really understand,

00:21:27.917 --> 00:21:30.875
but perhaps it would be better
to report everything honestly?

00:21:31.958 --> 00:21:33.083
You're right.

00:21:33.083 --> 00:21:37.250
If I'm honest, Lord Ilpalazzo
will be generous and forgiving.

00:21:38.208 --> 00:21:39.750
So, why are you holding that thing?

00:21:39.750 --> 00:21:42.542
No reason, just sort of holding it.

00:21:42.542 --> 00:21:44.417
Hail, Ilpalazzo!

00:21:44.417 --> 00:21:46.667
Hail, Ilpalazzo.

00:21:46.667 --> 00:21:48.083
Reporting in!

00:21:48.083 --> 00:21:50.750
We lost track of
the messenger, Mr. Key!

00:21:50.750 --> 00:21:53.750
Therefore, I am thinking of going
out now in search of Mr. Key--

00:21:53.750 --> 00:21:55.750
There is no need for that.

00:21:59.417 --> 00:22:00.708
A heavy bell...

00:22:00.708 --> 00:22:02.542
Hey, Hatchan, wrong character.

00:22:02.542 --> 00:22:04.667
Breathe in. Breathe in, breathe in.

00:22:04.667 --> 00:22:05.458
"Episode 21: Visually Appealing Type"
Breathe in. Breathe in, breathe in.

00:22:05.458 --> 00:22:06.208
"Episode 21: Visually Appealing Type"
Breathe out.

00:22:06.208 --> 00:22:07.667
"Episode 21: Visually Appealing Type"
I said that's the wrong character!

00:22:07.667 --> 00:22:09.917
"Episode 21: Visually Appealing Type"
And for the rest, you say mokyuu.

00:22:09.917 --> 00:22:11.250
"Today's Experiment..."
Wrong one, damn it!

00:22:11.250 --> 00:22:12.958
"Today's Experiment... Big Failure"

00:22:22.625 --> 00:22:26.167
One last passionate one at the end.

00:22:49.167 --> 00:22:57.500
<i>I knew, ever since that day</i>

00:22:57.500 --> 00:23:04.917
<i>The reason you had approached me</i>

00:23:04.917 --> 00:23:13.083
<i>Tender and soft</i>

00:23:13.083 --> 00:23:21.833
<i>That my body is to your taste</i>

00:23:22.792 --> 00:23:30.583
<i>To your hunger-stricken eyes</i>

00:23:30.583 --> 00:23:38.500
<i>How does my body seem</i>

00:23:38.500 --> 00:23:46.375
<i>If you are to eat me, do it in one blow</i>

00:23:46.375 --> 00:23:55.125
<i>So that the meat does not get hard</i>

00:23:57.042 --> 00:24:00.125
'Ello. It's Excel.

00:24:00.125 --> 00:24:03.875
That afro said he's tired of fast talking,

00:24:03.875 --> 00:24:08.750
so I'm delivering it really
dragged out this time.

00:24:08.750 --> 00:24:11.333
Oh, man.

00:24:11.333 --> 00:24:15.458
Oh, I didn't know that's what
the background music sounded like.

00:24:15.458 --> 00:24:17.833
Next time is um, uh...

00:24:17.833 --> 00:24:20.792
I see.

00:24:20.792 --> 00:24:23.583
Well, if you have a chance
to watch it, please do. Later.

00:24:23.583 --> 00:24:26.592
Oh, that was so nice and easy.
